# Security Manager — exteraGram security plugin
#
# Feature 1: detect a wrong Telegram passcode and silently send a text alert
# to Saved Messages, a chosen @username, or a Telegram bot (Bot API).
# Feature 2: a decoy passcode logs this device out of the account.
# Feature 3: hidden chats, revealed by a secret code in Telegram search.
#
# Install: copy this file to the device as passguard.plugin and enable it
# in exteraGram -> Settings -> Plugins.

